# SecondSelf — Week-Wise Implementation Plan

Derived from `Week_2_Session_1_Note.pdf`, `architecture.md`, and `Implementation-plan.md`.
Each phase is **self-contained**, testable on real data, and its output feeds the next phase.

> **Rule**: Complete phases in order. Test every phase on your own notes, links, and files. Check off acceptance criteria before moving to the next phase.

---

## Phase Overview

| Phase | Week | Name | Badge | Primary Output |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 0 | Pre-Week | Foundation | — | Repo scaffold, deps, shared libs |
| 1 | Week 1 | The Archivist | 🏅 The Archivist | `capture.py` + 10+ items in `raw/` |
| 2 | Week 2 | The Librarian | 🏅 The Librarian | Classified + linked `wiki/` (15+ items) |
| 3 | Week 3 | The Cartographer | 🏅 The Cartographer | `graph.json` + interactive graph |
